# Reachability probes for the synthetic fixture (tests/fixtures/make_fixture.py).
# Keyed on `title` because the fixture DB is rebuilt per run and uids are not stable.
#
# Three entry points per memory, and they must stay genuinely different:
#   natural — a full question, as asked of a colleague
#   keyword — the terse stab someone actually types
#   vague   — the PROBLEM described WITHOUT the distinctive proper nouns.
#             This one is the point of the file. If you "fix" a failing vague
#             probe by sneaking the proper noun back in, you have deleted the
#             measurement, not passed it.
